{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28522","headline":"奉送中丞姊夫俦自大理卿出镇江西叙事书怀因成十二韵 · 杜牧","name":"奉送中丞姊夫俦自大理卿出镇江西叙事书怀因成十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟帝忧南纪，搜贤与大藩。\n梅仙调步骤，庾亮拂橐鞬。\n一室何劳扫，三章自不冤。\n精明如定国，孤峻似陈蕃。\n灞岸秋犹嫩，蓝桥水始喧。\n红旓罣石壁，黑矟断云根。\n滕阁丹霄倚，章江碧玉奔。\n一声仙妓唱，千里暮江痕。\n私好初童稚，官荣见子孙。\n流年休挂念，万事至无言。\n玉辇君频过，冯唐将未论。\n庸书醻万债，竹坞问樊村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}